, it becomes a bridge!","It's too high to climb. The stick can reach it!","My tummy is rumbling. I'll get that berry.","My tummy is rumbling. I'll get that mushroom.","Okay, I'll put it down.","The berry is up high. As a spring I can jump up, grab it, and bring it back.","The berry is up too high. A spring can jump up there!","The fruit is up in the tree. I can whack it with the stick!","The fruit is up in the tree. If I'm a hard ball I can ram it!","The gate is low. As a puddle I can slide under, grab the mushroom and slide back out.","The gate is very low. If I'm a flat puddle I can slide under it!","The wizard wants a berry. I'll carry it to the tower instead of eating it.","The wizard wants a mushroom. I'll carry it to the tower instead of eating it.","The wizard wants his stick. Grab it, then bring it to the tower.","The wizard wants me to be a ball. Squish!","The wizard wants me to be a blob. Squish!","The wizard wants me to be a puddle. Squish!","The wizard wants me to be a spring. Squish!","The wizard wants me to eat a berry. There's one I can reach.","The wizard wants me to eat a mushroom. There's one I can reach.","There's a gap in the way. A spring can jump over it!","There's a gap. If I push the rock into it, it becomes a bridge!"],"says":["Boing and back!","Boing boing!","Boing!","Boing, delivery!","Bonk and deliver!","Bonk!","Bridge and fetch!","Bridge time!","Fetched!","Food!","For you, wizard!","Fruit for the kids!","Fruit, fall down!","Got it!","Gotcha!","Heave ho!","Heave ho, got it!","Here you go!","Here's your stick!","Hook it!","I'm a ball!","I'm a blob!","I'm a puddle!","I'm a spring!","Look at me!","Meadow berry!","Mine now!","Munch munch~","Nap time.","Nom nom!","Okay!","Ooh, a stick!","Over I go!","Over and fetched!","Plop! For the tower.","Plop.","Ram!","Ram, grab, go!","Rock and roll!","Rolling in!","Slide and fetch!","Slide slide~","So sleepy...","Special delivery!","Sploosh!","Sploosh, got it!","Squeeze...","Squish!","Stick delivery!","S